@startuml "pipeline"
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class LogHubApplication
class PipelineReport
class LogProcessor
class LogFlowMediator {
  +Run(): ProcessingResult
  +ChangeImporter(importer): void
  -OnPressureChanged(overloaded): void
}
class ImportSession {
  +Paused: bool
  +Start(): void
  +TryRead(out item): bool
  +Pause(): void
  +Resume(): void
  +Stop(): void
}
interface ILogImporter
abstract class LogImporterBase
class MixedLogImporter
class JsonLogImporter
class InMemoryLogImporter
class ProcessingPipeline {
  +Enqueue(item): void
  +Drain(): void
  +PressureChanged: event
}
class FilterChain
class LogFormatter
class StatisticsVisitor
class PipelineEvents
class PipelineSubscriptions
LogHubApplication --> LogProcessor
LogHubApplication --> PipelineReport
LogProcessor --> LogFlowMediator
LogFlowMediator --> ImportSession
LogFlowMediator --> ProcessingPipeline : subscribes to pressure event
ImportSession --> ILogImporter : replaceable strategy
ILogImporter <|.. LogImporterBase
LogImporterBase <|-- MixedLogImporter
LogImporterBase <|-- JsonLogImporter
LogImporterBase <|-- InMemoryLogImporter
ProcessingPipeline --> FilterChain
ProcessingPipeline --> LogFormatter
ProcessingPipeline --> StatisticsVisitor
ProcessingPipeline --> PipelineEvents
ProcessingPipeline --> PipelineSubscriptions
PipelineReport --> StatisticsVisitor
PipelineReport --> ProcessedCounterObserver
PipelineReport --> CriticalAlertObserver
PipelineReport --> LogFlowMediator
PipelineReport --> PipelineEvents
note bottom of ProcessingPipeline
  Queue capacity is bounded.
  Full -> mediator pauses ImportSession.
  Empty -> mediator resumes ImportSession.
  No field referencing an importer.
end note
note bottom of LogFlowMediator
  Sequential cooperative scheduling.
  No Thread.Sleep, parallel workers or dropped batches.
end note
@enduml
